{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05288","headline":"荐福寺应制 · 萧至忠","name":"荐福寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地灵传景福，天驾俨钩陈。\n佳哉藩邸旧，赫矣梵宫新。\n香塔鱼山下，禅堂鴈水滨。\n珠幡映白日，镜殿写青春。\n甚懽延故吏，大觉拯生人。\n幸承歌颂末，长奉属车[尘]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}